[I] Hardware-accelerated video processing on Intel integrated GPUs

[T] Hardware-accelerated video processing on Intel integrated GPUs.

[U] https://github.com/Intel-Media-SDK/MediaSDK

[A] Intel-media-sdk Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS OBJDIR
[R] + x86 x86-64

[V] 23.2.2
[L] MIT

[D] 22d9de4298f0c747404d1d3e87c87a6adcba85a8d4115ada30717829 intel-mediasdk-23.2.2.tar.gz https://github.com/Intel-Media-SDK/MediaSDK/archive/

var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DBUILD_TOOLS=ON
pkginstalled libxcb && var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DENABLE_X11_DRI3=ON
pkginstalled opencl-clhpp opencl-headers || var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DENABLE_OPENCL=OFF
pkginstalled wayland wayland-protocols && var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DENABLE_WAYLAND=ON
